variables.tf

variable "username" {
  type    = string
  default = "Hyarel"
}

variable "age" {
  type    = number
  default = 25
}

output.tf

output "user_name" {
  value = var.username
}

output "user_age" {
  value = var.age
}

Run Commands

terraform init
terraform apply

Output

user_age = 25
user_name = "Hyarel"

-------------------------------



Variable Without Default Value

variables.tf

variable "city" {
  type = string
}


output.tf

output "city_name" {
  value = var.city
}


Execute

terraform apply -var="city=Pune"

Output:

city_name = "Pune"

-------------------


Using terraform.tfvars


variables.tf

variable "name" {
  type = string
}

variable "country" {
  type = string
}


terraform.tfvars
name    = "Hyarel"
country = "India"


output.tf

output "details" {
  value = "${var.name} lives in ${var.country}"
}


Output:

details = "Hyarel lives in India"


